%% End-to-end EDC pipeline (the 7-step flow demo'd in Step 2)
sequenceDiagram
    actor HKTaxi
    participant ConCP as Consumer<br/>Controlplane
    participant ConDP as Consumer<br/>Dataplane
    participant ProvCP as Provider<br/>Controlplane
    participant ProvDP as Provider<br/>Dataplane
    participant KMB as KMB Live API

    Note over HKTaxi,KMB: 1. Catalog discovery
    HKTaxi->>ConCP: POST /catalog/request
    ConCP->>ProvCP: DSP catalog request
    ProvCP-->>ConCP: dcat:dataset[asset-1, asset-2]
    ConCP-->>HKTaxi: Available offers

    Note over HKTaxi,ProvCP: 2-3. Negotiate contract
    HKTaxi->>ConCP: POST /contractnegotiations<br/>(asset-1, offer policy)
    ConCP->>ProvCP: DSP contract request
    ProvCP-->>ConCP: ContractAgreement
    ConCP-->>HKTaxi: state=FINALIZED<br/>+ contractAgreementId

    Note over HKTaxi,ProvDP: 4-5. Initiate transfer
    HKTaxi->>ConCP: POST /transferprocesses<br/>(HttpData-PULL)
    ConCP->>ProvCP: DSP transfer request
    ProvCP->>ProvDP: provision endpoint
    ProvDP-->>ConCP: STARTED + EDR

    Note over HKTaxi,KMB: 6-7. Pull real data
    HKTaxi->>ConCP: GET /edrs/{id}/dataaddress
    ConCP-->>HKTaxi: endpoint + JWT token
    HKTaxi->>ProvDP: GET endpoint<br/>Authorization: Bearer JWT
    ProvDP->>KMB: forward request
    KMB-->>ProvDP: 1611 KMB routes (JSON)
    ProvDP-->>HKTaxi: real Hong Kong bus data ✅
